Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.11,0:02:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,六年级时 老师让诺娜写拟人作文
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她干脆把自己比作自家那栋房子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.89,0:02:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她写 每回她和妹妹冲下楼\N房子的肚子就翻江倒海
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她们从后门出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,房子看着她们穿过围栏\N抄近路奔向马路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,然后淡出了视线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.46,0:02:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她好奇 房子是更喜欢\N空荡轻盈的样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还是更爱有人在时\N那种沉甸甸的感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,地板喜不喜欢被踩？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,墙会不会痒？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,房子会不会痛？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.78,0:03:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她觉得房子还是更喜欢有人气
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人和宠物都在这房子里生活过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,曾曾祖父去世的那间屋\N也是祖母的出生地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.97,0:03:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在那间屋是她父母的卧室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你从不关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:38.28,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx100\fscy100\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5\3c&H715C8C&\pos(751,772)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:38.32,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx104.45\fscy104.45\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.22\3c&H715C8C&\pos(763.3,776.18)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:38.36,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx104.79\fscy104.79\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.24\3c&H715C8C&\pos(766.66,777.99)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:38.40,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx104.91\fscy104.91\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.25\3c&H715C8C&\pos(770.66,780.3)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:38.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx105.01\fscy105.01\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.25\3c&H715C8C&\pos(776.69,780.97)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还能不能一起过了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.44,0:03:38.49,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx105.25\fscy105.25\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.26\3c&H715C8C&\pos(783.01,779.92)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:38.53,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx105.3\fscy105.3\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.27\3c&H715C8C&\pos(788.87,777.61)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:38.57,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx106.01\fscy106.01\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.3\3c&H715C8C&\pos(794.32,776.28)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:38.61,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx106.5\fscy106.5\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.32\3c&H715C8C&\pos(799.31,774.43)}诺娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:38.65,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx106.74\fscy106.74\frz30.26\c&H291368&\bord5.34\3c&H715C8C&\pos(803.2,772.81)}诺娜
